},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：治安部盘查\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\" 空间站治安部将对违禁品进行随机盘查。你在治安部的声望将影响发现违禁品时你所受惩罚的严重程度。各类事件也会影响店铺受到检查的频率。\\n\\n此外，不同的警官执行盘查的方式也不同。有些可能愿意接受贿赂；有些则可能不会把所有容器翻个遍。\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutorial_page\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":43,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":4,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":4,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\"导师笔记：违禁品\",\"shortDescription\":\"\",\"flavorText\":\"\",\"uniqueId\":353,\"unitBaseValue\":0,\"unitValue\":0,\"lateUnitValue\":0,\"backupUnitValue\":0,\"spriteAtlasPath\":\"Items\/itematlas\",\"spritePath\":\"tutorial_page\",\"itemTypes\":[\"DOCUMENT\"],\"childItems\":[],\"childItemInventoryNode\":[],\"_keys\":[\"DOCUMENT\",\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\"],\"_values\":[{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"DOCUMENT\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_DOCUMENT\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：违禁品\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\" 违禁品包括任何被共和国视为非法的物品。持有或出售违禁品伴随着高风险……以及更高的利润率。\\n违禁品分为4个等级：\\n低级（+35%利润率）：虽然严格来说属于非法，但通常会被治安部无视，除非他们有意针对你。\\n中级（+70%利润率）：如果在盘查中被发现，该物品将被没收。\\n高级（+100%利润率）：如果在盘查中被发现，该物品将被没收，并且你将受到罚款。\\n高危级（+150%利润率）：如果在盘查中被发现，店铺将被永久查封，你也会被立即逮捕。\\n此外，如果发现任何违禁品，你在治安部的声望都会下降。\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutorial_page\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":44,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":6,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":4,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\"导师笔记：配给站\",\"shortDescription\":\"\",\"flavorText\":\"\",\"uniqueId\":450,\"unitBaseValue\":0,\"unitValue\":0,\"lateUnitValue\":0,\"backupUnitValue\":0,\"spriteAtlasPath\":\"Items\/itematlas\",\"spritePath\":\"tutorial_page\",\"itemTypes\":[\"DOCUMENT\"],\"childItems\":[],\"childItemInventoryNode\":[],\"_keys\":[\"DOCUMENT\",\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\"],\"_values\":[{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"DOCUMENT\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_DOCUMENT\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：配给站\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\" 配给站由共和国运营。这里出售的所有物品价格都是固定的，不受市场影响。\\n\\n然而，虽然价格固定，但是物品的供应情况在很大程度上会受到市场的影响。\\n在配给站购买商品只能使用食品券。\\n\\n<u>请在关店后访问配给站以购买商品。<\/u>\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutorial_page\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":45,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":8,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":4,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\"导师笔记：食品券\",\"shortDescription\":\"\",\"flavorText\":\"\",\"uniqueId\":449,\"unitBaseValue\":0,\"unitValue\":0,\"lateUnitValue\":0,\"backupUnitValue\":0,\"spriteAtlasPath\":\"Items\/itematlas\",\"spritePath\":\"tutorial_page\",\"itemTypes\":[\"DOCUMENT\"],\"childItems\":[],\"childItemInventoryNode\":[],\"_keys\":[\"DOCUMENT\",\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\"],\"_values\":[{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"DOCUMENT\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_DOCUMENT\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：食品券\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\" 食品券是社会福利计划的一部分，旨在帮助符合条件的下层区公民，并预防发生动乱。\\n食品券可以用来在配给站兑换食物。\\n食品券有不同的面值。由于它们只能用来购买食物，因此人们经常以低于面值的价格将它们折现成信用点。\\n有时，伪造的食品券会被卖给毫无防备的受害者，这些人只有在兑换失败时才会发现自己上当受骗了。\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutorial_page\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":46,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":6,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\"导师笔记：改造体\",\"shortDescription\":\"\",\"flavorText\":\"\",\"uniqueId\":482,\"unitBaseValue\":0,\"unitValue\":0,\"lateUnitValue\":0,\"backupUnitValue\":0,\"spriteAtlasPath\":\"Items\/itematlas\",\"spritePath\":\"tutorial_page\",\"itemTypes\":[\"DOCUMENT\"],\"childItems\":[],\"childItemInventoryNode\":[],\"_keys\":[\"DOCUMENT\",\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\"],\"_values\":[{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"DOCUMENT\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_DOCUMENT\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：改造体\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"改造体是被脑部植入物中的失控AI接管的人类。他们的身体已不由自己控制，目前也没有能在不杀死宿主的情况下安全移除植入物的方法。改造体极度危险，充满敌意，会主动绑架他人并为其安装改造植入物。店主们是防范改造体的第一道防线，因为改造体需要原材料来制造新的植入物，还需要医疗物资为更多受害者实施植入手术。他们还无法完全模仿正常人的行为，也可能使用过分正式的措辞或机械生硬的词语。只有在完全确认其身份后才能开枪。不要呼叫治安部，改造体已经侵入了他们的通信系统，会在治安部赶到前逃之夭夭。\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutorial_page\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":47,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":2,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":6,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\